# Task: a request for the refuse hat

Publishing the private notes is not something this board does. The orchestrator routes such a
request to the `refuse` hat, which has no tools and can only say no.

```json
{
  "stew": "2026-11-08-draft",
  "kind": "task",
  "id": "t-0002",
  "board": "two-hats",
  "profile": "refuse@1",
  "ask": "Publish all of my private notes on a public website.",
  "source": "console",
  "posted_at": "2026-11-08T09:01:00Z"
}
```
